    "source_kind": "screenplay",
    "content": "A caption-led visual explainer of the Olin construction: trace the coordinate recipe, reveal its 10,000-point planar shadow, animate the formula through time, prove an exact depth lift preserves that shadow, contrast it with a cylindrical reinterpretation, and close on both views together.",
